 own pre-token value baseline. Targets can be shared within a turn while advantages remain different.</div></div><div class="node token soft" id="GT-g3" data-map-node style="left:815px;top:774px;width:70px;height:72px"><div class="action">g₃</div><div data-node-detail>Generated position g3. TB-GAE retains this position’s own pre-token value baseline. Targets can be shared within a turn while advantages remain different.</div></div><div class="node token soft" id="GT-g4" data-map-node style="left:940px;top:774px;width:70px;height:72px"><div class="action">g₄</div><div data-node-detail>Generated position g4. TB-GAE retains this position’s own pre-token value baseline. Targets can be shared within a turn while advantages remain different.</div></div><div class="node reward" id="GT-reward" data-map-node style="left:1070px;top:774px;width:90px;height:72px"><div class="action">R = 1</div><div data-node-detail>Reward is injected once at the final generated position, forming a terminal TD residual; recursion then proceeds backward through generated positions.</div></div><div class="connection" data-from="GT-reward" data-to="GT-g4" data-relation="soft"><div class="edge soft arrow" style="left:1070px;top:810px;width:60.0px;transform:rotate(180.0deg)"></div></div><div class="connection" data-from="GT-g2" data-to="GT-g1" data-relation="soft"><div class="edge soft arrow" style="left:425px;top:810px;width:55.0px;transform:rotate(180.0deg)"></div></div><div class="label hop" style="left:383.5px;top:743px;">1</div><div class="connection" data-from="GT-g3" data-to="GT-g2" data-relation="soft"><div class="edge soft arrow" style="left:815px;top:810px;width:320.0px;transform:rotate(180.0deg)"></div></div><div class="label hop" style="left:641.0px;top:743px;">q</div><div class="connection" data-from="GT-g4" data-to="GT-g3" data-relation="soft"><div class="edge soft arrow" style="left:940px;top:810px;width:55.0px;transform:rotate(180.0deg)"></div></div><div class="label hop" style="left:898.5px;top:743px;">1</div><div class="label " style="left:574px;top:821px;width:190px;">Skip obs.</div><div class="label weight" style="left:300px;top:865px;">Terminal residual weight: q = 0.72; no within-turn decay</div><div class="rule" style="left:42px;top:920px;width:1118px"></div><div class="label section" style="left:42px;top:946px;">Shared turn targets; a distinct advantage for each prefix</div><div id="GT-turn1" class="node value-card" data-map-node style="left:300px;top:1006px;width:350px;height:280px"><div class="action">Turn 1</div><div class="matrix"><div class="token-name">g₁</div><div class="token-name">g₂</div><div class="">0.20</div><div class="">0.40</div><div class="target">0.81</div><div class="target">0.81</div><div class="advantage">0.61</div><div class="advantage">0.41</div></div><div data-node-detail>At the next turn’s start, V=0.5 and A=0.5. The shared target is U₁=0.9×(0.5+0.8×0.5)=0.81. Each prefix subtracts its own V, giving A₁=0.81−0.2=0.61 and A₂=0.81−0.4=0.41.</div></div><div id="GT-turn2" class="node value-card" data-map-node style="left:790px;top:1006px;width:350px;height:280px"><div class="action">Turn 2</div><div class="matrix"><div class="token-name">g₃</div><div class="token-name">g₄</div><div class="">0.50</div><div class="">0.80</div><div class="target">1.00</div><div class="target">1.00</div><div class="advantage">0.50</div><div class="advantage">0.20</div></div><div data-node-detail>Turn 2 ends in true termination, with only terminal reward 1. Both generated positions therefore share target 1; subtracting their own V gives advantages 0.5 and 0.2.</div></div><div class="label row" style="left:42px;top:1125px;">Pre-token value V</div><div class="label row" style="left:42px;top:1178px;">Shared target U</div><div class="label row" style="left:42px;top:1231px;">Adv. A = U − V</div><div class="label " style="left:300px;top:1302px;width:840px;">U₁ = 0.9 × (0.5 + 0.8 × 0.5) = 0.81</div><div class="label " style="left:42px;top:1374px;